+# TLS certificate verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification stays enabled on all builds, development builds included. Local testing uses self-signed certificates, which are trusted explicitly, instead of turning verification off. The project also records that HTTPS is used everywhere, with no plaintext exception, because certificate management is now in place.
